%% Waitlist and auto-promotion
%% Status: current | Related: apps/api/src/services/waitlistPromotion.js
flowchart TD
  Book[Public or staff book] --> Full{slot full for party?}
  Full -->|no| Res[Create reservation CONFIRMED/PENDING]
  Full -->|yes| WL[Insert reservation_waitlist\nreservation.waitlist = true]
  WL --> Notify[Notification stub / log]
  Cancel[Cancel or reduce party on reservation] --> Promo[waitlistPromotion service]
  Promo --> Offer[Offer next waitlist entry slot]
  Staff[Staff board] --> Manual[POST waitlist/:id/manually-promote]
  Manual --> Offer
  Offer --> Accept{guest accepts?}
  Accept -->|yes| Res
  Tier[waitlist_auto_promo feature\nFree/Platinum on, Silver off] -.-> Promo
